<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Hebrai</book>
  <para style="h">Hebrai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebrai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrai</para>
  <para style="mt">Hebrai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hlâno ta hrohsopazy hmâpa ta Khazohpa ta miah pathlatuhpazy hnohta ei hluhpi nata kyh to ta bie vaw reih tyh ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />he noh hnôhchaipazy lia deikua cha, a Sawchapawpa hmâpa ta eima hnohta bie a reih. A Sawchapawpa cha ato ryutotuhpa ta rao ta, ano hmâpa ta khizaw he a tao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ano cha Khazohpa rônahna khaihpaliepa nata Khazohpa chhichâna a hneipa châ ta, a bie hmotaotheina bie ta ato a pabohsa. Moleinazy a pathaisa khai tawhta, chô lâ Beichaipa chachâh lâta a tyuh ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpazy moh hlâta Sawchapawpa ryuto moh â sâh viapa hawhta, Sawchapawpa cha vâlyuhchâpazy hlâta a sâh via syulyupa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpazy hry liata ahy hnohta ma Khazohpa ta, “Ei Sawchapawpa châ chi ta, Tanoh he na Paw ei châ,” a tah beih tly? Cha leipa chhao ta, ahy vâlyuhchâpa hnohta ma, “Ano châta Paw châ aw na ta, Ano cha kei châta Sawchapawpa a châ aw,” a tah beih tly?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawchapaw uhtheipa khizaw lâ a za tua nona khata, “Khazohpa vâlyuhchâpa zydua ta ano a naoh mawh ei sy,” tah heih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpazy kyh liata, “Vâlyuhchâpazy cha thlih pachâsa ta, A chakaotuhpazy chhao meipaleih a pachâsa tyh,” tah heih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sawchapawpa kyh liata deikua cha, hetana heta a tah: “Hy Khazohpa, na beidyuchhai cha, Chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta y ta, Siana chôchahrei cha, Na khinarâh chôchahrei a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siana pasô chi ta, Moleina nâ hao; Chavâta Khazohpa, na Khazohpa ta, Na viasazy hlâta rônah viapa ta, Thaphana sathaw a cha thu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hy Abeipa, nâ cha Âthaona liata leilô abôna a bôtuhpa châ chi ta, Avâzy khi na kuzô a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chazy cha leidia aw ei ta, Nâ deikua khâ na y aw; Chysia hawhta chy khai aw ei ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Poh hawhta âmo cha loh aw chi ta, Chysia hawhta thlapa ama châ aw. Nâ deikua cha na ualua ta khâ y chi ta, Na kôzy chhâ beih aw vei.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa ahy hnohta hmah, “Na chariahzy na phei tlyna ta ei tao hlâlei cha, Ei chachâh lâta a tyuh mah y,” tah beih hra vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpa zydua cha pachhana ryu a to awpazy chakao awpa ta tuapa chakaona thlahpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta bie eima theipazy kha eima pachâ peimawh pachai awpa a châ. Chataleipatala biezy cha eimâ sysai pathlei aw na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vâlyuhchâpazy hmâpa ta bie reipa hmahta a i sala, paraona nata reingiah leina tozy ta viarithôna dopa a hmô lymâ khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />he tlu ta pachhana rônahpa he diathlâ ei sih la, kheihta e eimâ boh thei aw? Cha pachhana bie cha Abeipa ta phuah tua ta, a theituhpazy ta keimo châta ama pa-i.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khazohpa chhao ta ngianazy, hmonoâhpazy nata hmotaotheina to ta nata a khozie hawhta Thlahpa Pathaihpa hmopiepazy piepa ta a pahnokhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khizaw vaw y awpa thâtih eima reipa he vâlyuhchâpazy biehneina liata soh vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khataih liata tlyma, “Chyhsapa he khâpa châ ta ma, Pachâ kaw chi ta; Chyhsa sawchapawpa he khâpa châ ta ma, Na mohôh tly?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bohpi leipa chhôh châta, Vâlyuhchâpazy hlâta a hnai viapa ta tao chi ta, Rônahna nata palyupalihna lakho na pakho; Na ku hmotaopazy chô liata hyutuhpa ta tao chi ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A phei ry liata ato na soh khai,” tahpa ta pa-ipa a châ. Chatanachata ato ano ry liata soh ta, ano biehneina khô lâta a sopa khâpa hmah y vei. Tahmâ deikua cha, ato ano ry liata a ypa hmô mâh ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Châhrasala bohpi leipa chhôh vâlyuhchâpazy hlâta a hnai viapa ta tao chypa Zisu cha, thina pasa a taopa vâta, tahmâ cha rônahna nata palyupalihna lakho pakhopa ta a ypa hmô pi ta, Khazohpa ngiachhiena zawhzi ta chyhsa to châta thina a padi haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ano châta nata ano zawhzi ta ato a ypa Khazohpa ta, saw hluhpi rônahna lâ a chhipa ta ama pachhana a taotuhpa Krista cha, pasa taona siepahliepa ta pakina patosa â chhuahpa cha, a châna awpa rai a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathaisatuhpa nata pathaisapazy cha ama zydua ta mopakha tawhta a puapa ama châ. Chavâta Zisu ta âmo cha unawhzy tah awpa a noza vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ei unawhzy hnohta na moh phuah aw na ta, Apakhypazy hry liata na reithaina hla ei sa aw,” tah ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ano liata ngâna ei pahnieh aw,” tah heih ta, “Moh tua u, Kei nata Khazohpa ta eina piepa sawzy hih,” a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawzy cha sapa nata thisaih azaona a hneipa ama châpa hawhta, ano chhao sapa nata thisaih hnei hra ta, a thina ta thina hmotaotheina a hneipa ahripa cha a pahleipadia haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatanachata thi riah china sei ta hro chhôh a tâhpa zydua a pachha ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmeiseihta la, vâlyuhchâpazy bao leipa ta, Abarahâ pathlazy tlao a bao ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chavâta chyhsazy châta molei reihpha cheina tao awpa ta, Khazohpa chakaona liata zawngiah theipa nata ngâchhihpa theihthai beichaipa a châ thei nawpa ta, kyh to liata a unawhzy hawhta a y awpa cha a byuhpa rai a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ano tlai ta reipasaona a tyh ta, pasa a vaw tao hapa vâta, reipasaona a tyhpazy a bao thei ei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta unawh pathaihpa, vârâh awna a to hrapazy saih u, eimâ ngiapâna palâhâhna lyuhchâpa nata Theihthai Beichaipa Zisu thâtih pachâ tyh muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mawsi cha Khazohpa chhôhkha zydua hry liata ngâchhihpa a châpa hawhta, Zisu cha ano a raotuhpa liata ngâchhihpa â châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />O hlâta o satuhpa ta palyupalihna a hlao viapa hawhta, Zisu cha Mawsi hlâta rônahna a to tlâh viapa ta raopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />O to a satuhpa a hnei khaipa hawhta, ato zydua a taotuhpa cha Khazohpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmialâ daihti liata bie rei awpazy pa-i nawpa ta, Mawsi cha Khazohpa o liata chakaotuhpa ngâchhihpa châ ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista deikua cha, Khazohpa o chô liata Sawchapawpa ngâchhihpa a châ. Eimâ lôhna nata eima hnabeiseihna liata eimâ palaikheipazy â ipa ta eima patu khiahta cha, keimo he Krista o cha eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta Thlahpa Pathaihpa ta, “Tanoh he a ao nama thei khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Râhchawhpa liata pasiapa nama châ nota, Nama chhorupa hawhna khata, Nama palôh kuh pachhasa khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Châ pathlatuhpazy khata, Cha liata na pasia ei ta; Ei hmotaopazy kô sypalih chhôh ama hmô.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kha chhâ khata ei hie na pahâh ei ta, ‘Ama palôh liata viavipa ta, Ei lâpizy pahno veih ei,’ tah na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathi iapa ta bie ei taihpa hawhta, ‘Ei pahâna liata a ngia aw veih ei,’” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unawh saih u, a sohsi teh u. Chataleipatala nama hry liata ahy chhôh liata tlyma ngiapâleina palôh moleina vaw y aw ta, Khazoh hrohpa nama paosai pathlei aw na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nama hry liata ahy hmah moleina ta dôveina liata kuhchhapa ta nama y lei nawpa ta, “tanoh” tahpa a châ chhôh zydua cha, noh chareih ta a pasyu raihrie teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Âthaona liata eimâ ngiapâna alôhna kha achhâna taihta eima patu khiahta cha, Krista a hneituhpazy eima châ. Chavâta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tanoh he a ao nama thei khiahta cha, Chhorupa ta nama y no hawhna khata, Nama palôh kuh pachhâsa khuh vy,” tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cha khiahta la pahno thlâh tlôh ta ano a dyuhpazy kha ahyzy ma ama châ? Mawsi chhihthapa ta Izi râh tawhta a kaw puapa zydua kha châ veih ei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kô sypalih chhôh a hie a pahâhpazy kha ahyzy ma ama châ? Moleina hmo a taopa, râhchawhpa liata ama ri a zawhpazy kha châ veih ei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Â pahâna liata a ngia lei awpa ta bie â taihpazy kha ahyzy ma ama châ? Reingiah leipazy kha châ veih ei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amâ ngiapâleipa vâta a ngia thei khao veih ei tahpa eima pahno.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta â pahâna liata a ngia awpa bietai y thlâh ha tlôhpa ta, nama hry liata a ngia tlâh leipa nama y pathlei lei nawpa ta, chi ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama hnohta thâtihpha chhopa a châpa hawhta, keimo hnohta chhao chhopa châ ta, châhrasala bie ama theipa cha ngiapâna ta a pa-i leipa vâta, âmo châta phahnaina hnei vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimo, ngiapâ hapazy pi he, cha apahâna liata a ngiapazy cha eima châ. Leilô bô tua no tawhta raizy paloh hapa a châ tarawpa ta, hetana heta a tah: “Hiehâpa ta bie ei taih hapa hawhta, ‘Ei pahâna liata a ngia aw veih.’”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khataih su liata tlyma, noh sarina noh kyh liata, “Noh sarina noh liata Khazohpa ta a raihria zydua tawhta â pahâ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rei chiehpa liana khata, “Ei pahâna liata a ngia aw veih ei,” tah heih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thokha cha apahâna liata a ngia aw ei ta, thâtihpha a dao tuapa thokhazy deikua cha, ama reingiah leina vâta a ngia thei aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bohpi tawhna khata Dâvi hmâpa ta, “Tanoh,” tahpa ta, noh kheihawhpa tlyma rao chanei heih ta, rei chiehpa hawhta, hetana heta a reih chanei heih: “Tanoh he a ao nama thei khiahta cha, Nama palôh kuh pachhasa khuh vy.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zawsua ta apahâna a vaw pie ha khiah ei ta cha, cha hnôhlâ ta noh hropa kyh Khazohpa ta reih khao aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa phopi châta cha, a pahâ nawpa Pahânoh a y thlâh ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khazohpa ta a raihriazy tawhta â pahâpa hawhta, Khazohpa apahâna liata a ngia hapa cha, a raihriazy tawhta â pahâ hra aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chavâta reingiah leina vâta ama paopa hawhna khata ahy hmah ama pao lei nawpa ta, cha apahâna liata a ngia awpa ta tei ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khazohpa bie cha hroh ta, hmo tao thei ta, zaozi hâh nopa hlâta tiah via ta, hrona nata thlahpa, ru nata lathli pachhaih theina taihta chhôpahlie thei ta, palôh pachâna nata achhuahnazy a pahno thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mohmô tawhta a nyu theipa hmotaopa rai y vei. Eima thâtih eima tlôkhei nawpa mohmô liata cha, ato thluahruapa nata pahy chiehpa ta a y khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatanachata avâzy a siepahliepa theihthai beichaipa rônahpa, Khazohpa Sawchapawpa Zisu eima hneipa vâta, eimâ ngiapâna palâhâhna cha khâchâ patu ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eima chiehleinazy miah a pahnokhei thai leipa theihthai beichaipa a hneipa châ leipa pi ta, keimo hawhta kyh to liata reipasaona a tyh ta, châhrasala a molei leipa theihthai beichaipa eima hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chavâta zawngiahna eima hmô thei nawpa nata bao eimâ ngiah daihti liata miah bao awpa ta ngiachhiena eima hmô thei nawpa ta, ngiachhiena beidyuchhai cha riahphapa ta a hnia suh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Theihthai beichaipa cha, chyhsazy vyuhpa ta Khazohpa nata azaona rai hria awpa ta chyhsazy hry tawhta atlyhpa châ ta, moleinazy châta hmopiepa nata atheihnazy hlâ awpa ta raopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ano chhao chiehleina a hneipa a châpa vâta, pahno leipazy nata lâpi paviapazy cha chado kawpa ta a chhihtha thei ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cha hawhta a châpa vâta, chyhsazy moleina châta atheihna a hlâpa hawhta, ano moleinazy châta chhao atheihna a hlâ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cha palyupalihna cha ahy hmahta anosasyh ta a patosa thei vei. Arawna hawhta Khazohpa ta a awpa a châ khiah dei ta a to thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Krista chhao ta theihthai beichaipa châ awpa ta anosasyh ta a cheihchalo vei. “Ei Sawchapawpa châ chi ta, Tanoh he na Paw ei châ,” tahpa ta a hnohta a reihtuhpa ta a raopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Su hropa liata chhao, ano a raotuhpa ta, “Melkizade theihthaipa châna lâpi a chhihpa ta, Chhâzaw theihthaipa na châ” tahpa ta a reih heih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sapa pôhpa ta a hro chhôh ta, Zisu cha thina tawhta a pachha theituhpa lâ ao paro ngaitapa ta mothlih chhaota awh ta, thlahchhânazy nata hianazy hlâ ta, Khazohpa a chizana vâta a thlahchhâna cha nathliepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sawchapawpa a châ tarawpa ta, a pasa taonazy liata reingiahna a chu ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chavâta pakipa ta taopa vaw châ ta, a rei a ngiahpa zydua châta chhâzaw pachhana hnawh a vaw châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Melkizade theihthaipa châna lâpi a chhih ta, Khazohpa ta ano cha theihthai beichaipa ta a tao haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cha kyh liata bie hluhpi rei awpa eima hnei. Nama nah a pâ hapa vâta chhopasia deikua a ru kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A daihti pachâpa ta, pachutuhpa a châ bâ awpa châ ei chi ta, châhrasala Khazohpa bie thabypa pachu namâ ngiah thlâh ha chy. Sâhpiti a ngiah chy ei chi ta, pati hmeiseihpa nie thei mâh veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sâhpiti ta chyh a ngiahpa maih cha, hawsaih a châpa vâta, siana bie kyh liata pahnona hnei leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pati hmeiseihpa deikua cha, pitlohpazy châta châ ta, pati hmeiseihpa nie amâ chu lymâpa vâta, chhie nata pha pahrua thaina a hneipa pitlohpazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta Krista thâtih pachu pathaonazy tawhta laiseih lymâpa ta, pitlohna lâ pangai ei suh u. Hmotao thipazy liata rona lôbôzy bô chanei leipa ta, Khazohpa ngiapâna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />bâtina, ku pahniehna, athihpa thyuheihna nata chhâzaw pachiana thâtih pachu pathaonazy liata y khao khah ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khazohpa ta â ryh a tah khiahta cha, cha cha eima tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ei kha nopavâhpa ta y ha ta, vârâh hmopiepa padi ta, Thlahpa Pathaihpa raihria liata a hlao ha ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khazohpa bie phana padi ta, daihti vaw y awpa liata hmotaotheina padi ha tawh chhao ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama paosai heihpa khiahta cha, ama rao nawpa ta Khazohpa Sawchapawpa a khaipâ chanei heihpa nata maoh a paphyuhtuhpazy ama châpa vâta, cha hawhpa chyhsazy rona lâ a chhi heih awpa cha hmo thei leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khihti a hmô phapa chhaohlei cha, raihriatuhpazy châta niedo papuapa ta, Khazohpa tawhta byhnâ a daopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chhaohlei ta ahloh nata bôbawzy a papua khiahta deikua cha, hnypa ta y ta, chhiesa thlupa châ ta, a chhâ nawpa cha mei ta rao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Châhrasala kho ngaitapa saih u, cha hawhta reih hra sih la, nâmo kyh liata la, hmo pha viapa, pachhana kyh hmozy nama tao aw tahpa eimâ lôh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nama raihria tyhpa nata a moh vâta kyhpachâna palâsapa ta mopathaihpazy nama chakao tyhpa, tahmâ taihta nama taopa he, mopakhô awpa ta Khazohpa cha adoleipa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnabeiseihna ipa hnei awpa ta nama tiama tyhpa hawhna khata, achhâna taihta tiama papua lymâ awpa ta eima cha khokhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chatanachata diathlâ leipa aw ei chi ta, ngiapâna nata hâ hualuana vâta bietai ryu totuhpazy hâlatuhpa tlao nama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khazohpa ta Abarahâ hnohta bietai a tao nona kha, ano hlâta rônah viapa moh reipa ta bie â taih nawpa a y leipa vâta, anosasyh ta bie a taih ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Byhnâ cha awpa tlai aw na ta, ei cha papôh tlai aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatanachata Abarahâ cha palôh pasi ngaitapa ta a hâ tawhta bietaipa cha hmô ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chyhsazy ta âmo hlâta rônah viapa moh reipa ta bie a taih tyh ei ta, aeichhiana ama hneipa to liata chhao, bietai cha bietluna pa-ina châta ama hmâh tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khazohpa ta â chhuahna anano beih leipa cha, bietai ryutotuhpazy hnohta tha via ta a pamosa khoh tita, bietai hmâpa ta a pa-i tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chatanachata hmo anano beih leipa miano vâta, haipa bie rei awpa cha Khazohpa châta hmo thei leipa châ ta, a boh awpa ta ano lâ a râpazy pi heta eima hmiakô liata hnabeiseihna sopa cha thlalôhpa ta eima hnei thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cha hnabeiseihna cha eima hro a-ina nata abohna châta eima balyh thuacha-ia ta hnei pi ta, pohraipa chhôhchaipa lâ a ngiatuhpa hnabeiseihna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chatanachata Zisu cha eima vyuhpa ta hmia a sah ta, cha liata a ngia ta, Melkizade theihthaipa châna lâpi a chhihpa ta, chhâzaw theihthai beichaipa ta a y haw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha Melkizade, Salem bei nata Khazohpa Chônôchaipa theihthaipa chata, abeizy a thie khai tawhta â vaw liepa Abarahâ cha kei dy ta, byhnâ awpa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abarahâ ta a hraona sôh zydua tawhta su hrawh su kha a hnohta a pie. Melkizade cha a moh yzie tawhta siana bei châ tua ta, hnôhlâ ta Salem bei tahpa a châ. Salem bei tahpa cha adyhna bei tahna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ano cha paw hnei leipa ta, nô hnei hra leipa ta, pathlatuhpa alaichadai awpa hnei vei. Âthaona noh nata a hro chhâna nohzy rei awpa hnei hra leipa ta, Khazohpa Sawchapawpa lyupa ta taopa châ ta, chhâzaw ta theihthaipa ta a ypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cha chyhsa rônahzie cha pachâ tua u! Pathlatuhpa Abarahâ chhao khata hraona sôh tawhta su hrawh su kha a piepa kha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Livai pathlazy hry liata theihthaipa raihria a topa maih cha, ryhpa hawhta chyhsazy tawhta su hrawh su kha la awpa ta biepiepa ama châ. Cha chyhsazy cha Abarahâ pathla ama unawhzy châ ei ta, âmo tawhta su hrawh su kha ama la tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He chyhsa deikua he cha, ama phoheih a châ hra leipa chhao ta, Abarahâ tawhta su hrawh su kha dao ta, bietaizy a hneituhpa cha byhnâ a awpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rônah viapa ta a nawh viapa châta byhnâ a awpa tyhpa kyh cha, reipasipasua thei rimâ awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kyh kha liata cha, chyhsa thi theipazy hnohta su hrawh su kha piepa châ ta, kyh hropa liata deikua cha, hroh thlâhpa a châ tahpa pahnokheipa hnohta su hrawh su kha piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Su hrawh su kha a la tyhpa Livai tlai chhao kha, Abarahâ siepahliepa ta su hrawh su kha a pie hrapa hawhta pachâ theipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Melkizade ta Abarahâ a vaw dy nona kha, Livai cha ano pathlatuhpa Abarahâ thisaih liata a y hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Livai pathlazy theihthaina raihria ry liata chyhsazy ta ryhpa dao ei ta, cha Livai pathlazy theihthaipa châna tawhta pakina hmô theipa a châ khiahta cha, Melkizade theihthaipa châna lâpi a chhihpa ta theihthaipa hropa a vaw y awpa cha khazia â ngiah khao aw? Arawna theihthaipa châna lâpi a chhihpa ta rao awpa châ vei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Theihthaipa raihria siezie pananopa a châ khiahta cha, ryhpa chhao panano awpa a byuh tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thâtih eima reipa he chihropa châ ta, cha chi tawhta ahy hmah maisâh liata chakao beih veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eima Beipa cha Zudâh chi tawhta a vaw puapa a châzie pahnopasiapa châ ta, cha chi nata a zaopa ta Mawsi ta theihthaipazy kyh khâpa hmah reih vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Melkizade hawhpa theihthai hropa a vaw y nahta, cha kyh cha a sia via rili.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ano cha sapa chipathla liata a pahniehpa ryhpa hawhta theihthaipa ta raopa châ leipa ta, hro chhâna hnei leipa hmotaotheina hmâpa ta theihthaipa ta raopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chavâta ano kyh liata, “Melkizade theihthaipa châna lâpi a chhihpa ta, Chhâzaw ta theihthaipa na châ,” tahpa ta pahnokheipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biepiepa hmiatuapa cha, chiehleina nata phahnai leina a hneipa vâta hnypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ryhpa bie ta khâpa hmah pakisa thei vei. Hnabeiseihna pha viapa vaw tlô ta, cha hnabeiseihna vâna chata Khazohpa eimâ hnia thei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Melkizade theihthaipa châna lâpi a chhihpa ta theihthaipa a châpa Abeipa cha, bietai a hlao leipa ta theihthaipa ta raopa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kha hlâta theihthaipa a vaw châ tyhpazy kha, bietai tao leipa ta theihthaipa a vaw châ tyhpazy châ ei ta, he theihthaipa deikua he cha, “Abeipa ta bie a taih ha ta, A palôh panano aw vei, ‘Chhâzaw theihthaipa na châ,’” tahpa ta a hnohta bie a reituhpa bietai ta theihthaipa ta raopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cha bietai vâna chata Zisu cha biehrai pha viapa pa-ituhpa a vaw châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Theihthaipazy cha thina vâta ama raihria ama pazao lymâ thei leipa vâta, theihthai hmiatuapazy maluh ama hluh ngaita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zisu deikua cha, chhâzaw ta a hrohpa a châpa vâta, a thla beih leipa, chhâzaw theihthaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zisu cha chyhsazy châta thlahchhâ awpa ta chhâzaw ta a hroh thlâhpa a châpa vâta, ano siepahliepa ta Khazohpa a pangaipazy cha, khatino rai ta a pachha thei ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cha hawhpa theihthai beichaipa, pathaihpa, palôh phapa, apuapa a bai leipa, moleipazy tawhta pananopa nata avâzy chô lâta cheihchalopa eima hnei awpa cha â ngiahpa rai a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ano cha theihthai beichaipa hropazy hawhta, noh chareih ta ano moleinazy châta atheihna hlâ tuapa ta, cha khai tawhta chyhsazy moleina châta atheihna a hlâ chanei ngâ thlâh awpa byuh vei. Anosasyh ta chhâzaw châta ei kha â hlâna liata a pangoh khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ryhpa ta chiehleina a hneipa chyhsazy cha theihthai beichaipa ta rao tyh ta, ryhpa a y khai tawhta a vaw ypa bietai bie deikua ta cha, chhâzaw châta pakipa ta taopa Sawchapawpa cha theihthai beichaipa ta a rao haw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rei eimâ chhuahpa cha he he a châ: Cha hawhpa theihthai beichaipa cha hnei pi ta, ano cha vârâh liata Beichaipa beidyuchhai chachâh lâta a tyuhpa châ ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chyhsapa paduapa châ leipa ta, Abeipa paduapa achhyna byureih hmeiseihpa supathaihpazy liata chakaotuhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Theihthai beichaipa maih cha hmopiepa nata atheihnazy hlâ awpa ta raopa ama châ. Chavâta he theihthai beichaipa chhao he, khâpa chhâ tlyma hlâ awpa a hnei awpa a byuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Alei liata a ypa châ sala, ryhpa hawhta hmopiepa a hlâ awpa theihthaipazy ama ypa vâta, ano la theihthaipa a châ awpa byuh aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Theihthaipazy cha vârâh hmo nothlahpa nata nohpahlipazy ama chakao tyh. Mawsi kha achhyna byureih a sa chy ta a hnohta, “Hmo to a taozie awpa tlâh liata ei cha pahmôpa hawhna khata na tao khai awpa a châ,” tahpa ta a taozie chhopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tahmâ deikua, Krista cha biehrai pha viapa lyuhchâpa a châpa hawhta, chakaona rai pha via syulyupa to ha ta, cha biehrai cha bietai pha viapazy chô liata taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biehrai hmiatuapa kha seina hnei leipa vaw châ ha sala, biehrai hropa tlua a byuh lei awpa tlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sei nawpa ama hneipazy Khazohpa ta hmô ta, hetana heta a tah: “Pachâ teh u, Nohzy a vaw tlô hai, Abeipa ta a tah. Cha nohzy liata, Izarei phopi hnohta biehrai thiehpa tao aw na ta, Zudâh phopi hnohta chhao ei tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama pathlatuhzy Izi râh tawhta a chhi papua awpa ta, Ama ku ta ei patu noh ta, Ama hnohta bie ei hraipa hawhpa kha châ aw vei. Ei biehrai liata ama y thlâh ha leipa vâta, Âmo pachâ khao veih ei na, Abeipa ta a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cha nohzy hnôhlâ ta, Izarei pathlazy hnohta biehrai ei tao awpa cha he he a châ, Abeipa ta a tah: Ama pachânazy liata ei ryhpa biezy soh aw na ta, Ama palôhzy liata ei roh aw; Ama Khazohpa châ aw na ta, Ei phopi ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Abeipa pahno teh,’ tahpa ta, Vaih nata vaih a pachu raihrie khao leipa aw ei ta, Unawh nata unawh a pachu raihrie khao aw veih ei; A chyh chaipa tawhta a lai chaipa taihta, Ama zydua ta eina pahno khai aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama paraopazy liata zawh a ngiah aw na ta, Ama moleinazy a thei khao aw va na.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Biehrai thiehpa thâtih a reipa liata, a hmiatuapa cha a parohpa ta tao ta, paroh lymâ ta, a vaw machâ hapa cha, a lei patoh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Biehrai hmiatuapa chhao khata Khazohpa achhyna siekheizie nata lei liata supathaihpazy a hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Achhyna byureih sa ei ta, a chhôh tytuapa liata meiôh sona nata tlâhkhai nata Ypâna Viahchhâ sonazy y ta, cha cha Su Pathaihpa tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pohraipa mianona khô liata chhôhpadâhpa cha Su Pathaih Chaipa tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cha liata ropahâhpa raona ngôh maisâh nata ngôh ta pahupa biehrai byh y ta, biehrai byh chhôh liata mânâ yna ngôh beih, Arawna chôchahrei chhyh thaopa nata biehrai lôphiazy a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chô lâta cherubi rônahpazy y ei ta, chazy chata zawngiahna dyuchhai ama khu. Cha kyhzy cha tahmâ â kipa ta reih thei mâh ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cha hawhta ato pachhuahpanohpa a châ khai tawhta, theihthaipazy cha ama chakaona rai hria awpa ta, byureih tytuapa lâ cha noh chareih amâ ngia tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Byureih chhôh chaipa lâ deikua cha, theihthai beichaipa deita ta kô kha ta ei kha a ngia tyh ta, thisaih a chei leipa ta â ngia awpa châ vei. Cha thisaih cha ano châta nata zawpizy ta pahno leipa ta ama moleinazy atheihna châta a hlâ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha hmo paryhzie tawhna chata Thlahpa Pathaihpa ta he he a pahnosa: Achhyna byureih tytuapa â dua chhôh cha, Su Pathaih Chaipa liata angiana lâpi pahypa châ mâh vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha cha tahmâhlâ daihti châta pamosana a châ. Cha hmo paryhzie liata cha, hmopiepa nata atheihna hlâ tyhpazy heta achhytuhpa chhie nata pha pahnona pahro thei vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmopiepa nata atheihnazy cha niedozy nata apasipathaina nanopazy kyh deita châ ei ta, sapa lâ ryhpa, taopathina daihti tlô hlâta hmâ awpa ryhpazy deita ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Krista deikua cha, hmo phapa a vaw tlôpazy châta theihthai beichaipa ta â vy nota, achhyna byureih rônah viapa nata paki viapa siepahliepa ta a vy ta, cha cha ku ta sa leipa, he hmotaopazy hry liata a hlao leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Su Pathaih Chaipa lâ cha chhâzaw châta ei kha a ngia ta, miezy nata viahchaotawzy thisaih ta châ leipa ta, ano thisaih ta chhâzaw chatlaina a tao haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chyhsa pathaih leipazy chô liata mie nata viahchao tôhpazy thisaih nata viahchao zeinô raona paohpazy thiapa hmahta sapa pathaihna taihta a pathaisa thei khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chhâzaw Thlahpa zawhzi ta, seina hnei leipa ta Khazohpa lâ anosasy ta a hlâtuhpa thisaih chhochhi ta cha, eima chhie nata pha pahnona cha hmotaopa thipa tawhta Khazohpa hrohpa chakaona lâta a pathaisa via pachai aw dia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chavâta Krista cha biehrai thiehpa lyuhchâpa a châ. Biehrai hmiatuapa ry liata paraonazy chatlai nawpa ta Krista cha thi ta, chatanachata awpazy ta chhâzaw ryu to awpa bietai cha ama to thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bieryuhipa hawhta tao awpa ta, ryuhituhpa cha a thi ha tlai tahpa pasia ha tua awpa a byuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bieryuhipa cha ryuhituhpa a thi tawh deita ta hmâ theipa a châ. Ryuhituhpa a hro chhôh ta cha hmâ theipa châ mâh vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chavâta biehrai hmiatuapa chhao kha, thisaih leipa ta cha pa-i theipa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mawsi ta ryhpa biepiepa to zawpi zydua hnohta a phuah nona kha, viahchaotaw thisaih, mie thisaih, ti, sahmi pala saihdôhpa nata hisaw zy la ta, ryhpa châbu nata zawpi zydua thia ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“He he nama zyh awpa ta Khazohpa biepiepa biehrai thisaih a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata achhyna byureih nata chakaona hmobaoh zydua chhao thisaih ta a thia khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmeiseihta ta, ryhpa ry liata cha, ato zydua thisaih ta pathaisapa châ ta, thisaih palo leipa ta molei ngiahthaina rai y vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chavâta vârâh hmo a lyupazy hmahta atheihnazy ta pathaisa awpa a byuh khiahta cha, vârâh hmo hmeiseihpazy chhochhi cha, chazy hlâta atheihna pha via syulyupa ta pathaisapa ta a y awpa rai a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Krista cha a hmeiseihpa a lyupa ta taopa, ku ta sapa Su Pathaih Chaipa liata a ngia leipa ta, eima vyuhpa ta Khazohpa hmiakô liata a luah awpa ta, tahmâ vârâh liata â ngia hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Theihthai beichaipa cha kô chareih ano thisaih a châ leipa thisaih a cheipa ta Su Pathaih Chaipa liata a ngia tyh ta, Krista deikua cha â hlâ chanei ngâ thlâh ha awpa a ngiah vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cha hawhta châ leipa sala, leilô y tua no tawhta pasa a tao chanei ngâ thlâh ha aw. Châhrasala daihti chhâna lâ liata, chhâzaw châta ei kha a vaw luah ta, anosasyh ta atheihna ta a hlâpa ta moleina a pahlei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chyhsapa châta ei kha thi raopa châ ta, cha hnôhlâ ta pachiana a y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Krista chhao chyhsa hluhpi moleinazy siekhei awpa ta ei kha hlâpa ta y ta, a einona ta â vaw luah tita deikua cha, moleina siekhei awpa châ khao leipa aw ta, ngiatiah lei ta ano hâtuhpazy pachha awpa ta â vaw luah aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ryhpa cha hmo phapa a vaw y awpazy nohpahlipa dei châ ta, a hmeiseihpa a châ leipa vâta, kô chareih ta atheihna hlâ tyhpa a châpa chhao ta, a hlâtuhpazy châta pakina tlôkhei thei beih vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chata châ leipa sala, achhytuhpazy cha ei kha pathaisapa ama châ ha tawhta cha, molei a pahnona hnei khao leipa aw ei ta, atheihna ama hlâ tyhpa cha pachhâsa ha aw veih ei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Châhrasala cha atheihnazy liana chata kô chareih ta moleinazy pahnosa heihna a y tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Viahchao tôhpazy nata miezy thisaih ta moleinazy pahlei thei rimâ awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chavâta khizaw lâ â zu nona khata, Krista ta, “Atheihna nata hmohlâpazy khoh leipa chi ta, Pôhpa tlao nâ chhuanohpa chi ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Raopa hlâna nata moleina hlânazy liata Alyna rai hnei va chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hy Khazohpa, moh tua, Châbu chatypa liata ei thâtih ropa hawhta Na khopa tao awpa ta ei vy,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Atheihnazy, hmohlâpazy, raopa hlânazy nata moleina hlânazy khoh leipa chi ta, chazy liata alyna hnei hra va chi,” tah tua ta, chazy cha ryhpa hawhta hlâpa kyhzy a reipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta, “Moh tua, na khopa tao awpa ta ei vy haw,” tah ta, a vaw y awpa a pa-i thei nawpa ta a hmiatuapa cha a pahlei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cha hmochhuahpa hawhna chata, chhâzaw châta ei kha hlâpa Zisu Krista pôhpa ta pathaisapa ta eima y haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Theihthaipa maihta chakao awpa ta noh chareih a duah ei ta, moleinazy a siekhei thei leipa atheihna ama hlâ tyhpazy cha, a ualua ta ama hlâ chanei ngâ thlâh ha tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Krista deikua cha, moleinazy châta atheihna miakha, chhâzaw châta ei kha a hlâ khai tawhta, Khazohpa chachâh lâta a tyuh ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a khakhaipazy a phei tlyna ta taopa ama châ khai hlâlei a hâ thlâh chy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ei kha â hlâna ta a pathaisa hapazy cha, chhâzaw châta a pakipa ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlahpa Pathaihpa chhao ta, hetana heta reih ta, miah a pahnokhei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Cha nohzy hnôhlâ ta, Ama hnohta biehrai ei tao awpa cha, He he a châ, Abeipa ta a tah: Ama palôh liata ei ryhpa biezy soh aw na ta, Ama pachâna liata ei roh hra aw,” a tah khai tawhta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ama moleinazy nata ama paraonazy A thei khao aw va na,” tah heih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cha hawhta moleinazy a ngiahthaipa a châ ha khiahta cha, moleina châta atheihna hlâ awpa byuh khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chavâta unawh saih u, Zisu thisaih vâta Su Pathaih Chaipa liata eimâ ngia aw tahpa a lôh pi ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />pohraipa siepahliepa ta lâpi thiehpa nata hrohpa eima châta a pahy haw. He liata pohraipa he Krista pôhpa reina a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chatanachata Khazohpa chhôhkhazy chô liata theihthai rônahpa eima hneipa vâta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />eima palôh liata chhie nata pha pahnona pha leipazy pathaipa ta, eima pôhpa ti pathaihpa ta pasi sih la, ngiapâna liata alôhna a ipa hneipa ta Khazohpa a hnia ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eima hnabeiseihna palâhâhna cha, a zawvaw leipa ta khâchâ patu ei suh u, bie â taihtuhpa cha ngâchhihpa châ tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kyhpachâna nata hmo pha taona liata kheihta ma tha eimâ pathyu raihrie thei aw tahpa pachâ tyh ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thokha taozie hawhta, apakhynazy bâhsai leipa ta, tlao a pasyu raihrie ei suh u. Noh â hnia via rilipa nama hmôpa hawhta, thata a pasyu ei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Biehmeiseihpa pahnona eima hnei ha tawhta eima molei raruah lymâ khiahta cha, moleinazy châta atheihna y khao vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ryureina rarôh ypa nata ano dyuhtuhpazy a kâ patlô awpa hiehâhna mei tlao a y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mawsi ryhpa a papeisa leipazy cha, pahnokheituhpa pano tlyma, pathôh tlyma bie ta, zawngiahna a hlao leipa ta ama thi tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khazohpa Sawchapawpa tlypâ ta, ano pathaisana biehrai thisaih papuapaleipa ta, ngiachhiena Thlahpa ru a pachhôpa cha, kha tluta hriena tha viapa to sala nama pangiasa?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Phuh cha keima la awpa châ ta, kei ta viari ei thô aw,” a tahtuhpa eima pahno. “Abeipa ta a phopi a pachia aw,” a tahtuhpa chhao eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khazoh hrohpa ku liata paopa cha hmo rarôh y ngaitapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Châhrasala nama daihti hmiatuapa liata, nopavâhsapa ta nama y khai tawhta thata pasa nama taona nohzy kha a thei tyh muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A châh ta vâtlâh mohmô ta pasipasawhpa nata taolapa ta y ei chi ta, a châh ta pasipasawhna nata taolana a taopazy namâ duakhei tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keihrai daipazy thapasa ei chi ta, hmo hneipa pha viapa, a y kôzaw awpa nama hneipa nama pahnopa vâta, nama hmo hneipazy ama cha hrao tita, a ly kawpa ta namâ pyh thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chavâta namâ ngiapâna alôhna, lymâ rônahpa a hneipa cha thy khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khazohpa khopa nama tao khai tawhta, bietaipa nama hmô thei nawpa ta, daotheina namâ ngiahpa rai a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Bohpi leipa liata, A vy awpa cha â vy aw, Hawh aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ei chyhsa siapa cha, Ngiapâna ta a hroh aw; Hnôh a sypa deikua cha, A chô liata alyna rai hnei aw va na.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Châhrasala keimo la, leidia awpa ta hnôh a sypa sahlao liatapa châ ma pi. Ngiapâna ta hro a pabohsa awpazy tlao eima châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngiapâna cha hmo hnabeiseihpazy a y tlai tahpa pahnona châ ta, hmo hmô leipazy pahnopasiana a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cha ngiapâna vâna chata hlâno chyhsazy kha reithai ama hlao tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta khizaw he Khazohpa bie ta taopa a châ tahpa pahno pi ta, chavâta hmo eima hmôpazy he hmô theipa hmozy tawhta taopa châ veih ei tahpa eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Abela cha Kainâ hlâta atheihna pha viapa Khazohpa lâ hlâ ta, Khazohpa ta a hmopiepazy a pyh ta, ano cha reithai ta, mosiapa ta a rao. Â ngiapâna vâta, Abela cha a thi tawh chhao ta bie a reih lymâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Enawka cha thina a tyh lei awpa ta lapa châ ta, Khazohpa ta a la hapa vâta, ano cha hmôpa châ khao vei. Lapa a châ hlâ tawh chhao ta, Khazohpa a palysapa a châpa vâta reithaina a hlaopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngiapâna leipa ta cha Khazohpa palysa thei rimâ awpa châ vei. Khazohpa a pangaipa maihta, Khazohpa a y tahpa amâ ngiapâ awpa châ ta, ano a tluatuhpa cha Khazohpa ta lymâ a pie tyh tahpa amâ ngiapâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Nôah cha hmo a lâ leipazy kyh liata Khazohpa zikyurâna cha pachâ peimawh ta, Khazohpa chizapa ta, a chhôhkhazy pachha nawpa ta balyh a tu. Â ngiapâna ta khizaw thailei pachâsa ta, ngiapâna vâta hmôpa siana ryutotuhpa a vaw châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Abarahâ cha a ryuto râh lâ sie awpa ta awna zyh ta, khataih lâ ma a sie aw tahpa a pahno leipa chhao ta, a sie lymâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta bietai râh liata pahrâ awpa ta sie ta, chihropa râh liata ypa hawhta y ta, bietai miakha ryutolâhpa Aisika nata Zakaw zy chhaota poh ozy liata ama pahrâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chatanachata abônazy a hneipa, Khazohpa pachhuahpanohpa nata paduapa khihpi cha a hâ hualua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Sârâ cha saw phaoh thei ta, ano bie a taihtuhpa cha ngâchhihpa ta a raopa vâta, a nôpi tawhta saw a phaoh theipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chatanachata chapaw pakha, athipa hawhta pachâpa tawhta, avâ liata awhsi zie ta a hluhpa nata tilaipi ngiahkâ liata sadi rei tiah lei zie ta a hluhpa chipathlazy ama vaw pua haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cha zydua cha ngiapâna hneipa ta thi ha ei ta. Ama hnohta bietaipa hmozy ama to mâh leipa chhao ta, lâhlapi tawhta saipa ta a naoh ei ta, alei liata cha khichhaipa nata khitlyhpa dei ama châ tahpa ama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha hawhpa kyh a reihpa chyhsazy cha, ama râh sôhpahlôhpa a tluapazy ama châ tahpa ama palâsa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama puana râh cha saiheipa châ ei sala, kua heihna daihti rypaohpa ama hmô thlâh ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Châhrasala tahmâ cha, râh pha viapa a saduthliepa châ ei ta, cha cha vârâh liata a ypa a châ. Chavâta Khazohpa ta ama Khazohpa châ awpa a noza vei, ama châta khihpi taih a chhuahdy ha tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Abarahâ cha pasiapa ta a y nota, Aisika hlâ ta, bietaizy a totuhpa ta a sawchapaw matlupa cha a hlâ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Aisika liata na pathlazy a laichadaipa a châ aw,” tahpa ta chhopa chyhsa ta, a sawchapaw matlupa a hlâ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khazohpa cha athihpa chhao a pathyu thei tahpa a ngiapâ ta, Aisika cha a hmô pakhua haw. A hlâ hapa vâta Aisika cha a thi hapa hawhta pachâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Aisika ta hmo a vaw tlô awpazy kyh liata Zakaw nata Esaw byhnâ a awpa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Zakaw ta a thi chy ta, Zawsi sawchapawzy byhnâ awpa chyu ta, a chôchahrei pawhmao a hniehpa ta Khazohpa â chhy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Zawsi ta a thi chy ta, Izarei sawzy Izi râh tawhta pua awpa kyh reih ta, a ruzy taotia nawpa kyh a chho ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Mawsi a pi nona kha, hawsaih hmipha kawpa ta ama hmôpa vâta, a nôpawzy ta thla thôh chhôh nyu ei ta, bei biepiepa chhao chi veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Mawsi cha a vaw pitloh tawhta, Phiraoh sawchanô sawchapawpa ta bi awpa a dytha haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bohpi leipa chhôh molei phasana liata lôhrâ a patlôpa hlâta cha, Khazohpa chyhsazy hnohta taolana tao awpa tlao a tlyh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lymâ to awpa a saipa vâta, Krista vâta reipachhiena a tyhpa cha Izi râh ryuzy hlâta ryu sôh viapa ta a rao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta bei hiehâhna chhao chi leipa ta, Izi râh puasai ta, hmô thei leipa a hmôpa vâta pasa a tao hualua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sawchapaw uhtheipa pahleipadiatuhpa ta Izarei sawchapaw uhtheipazy a hria lei nawpa ta, ngiapâna ta Zawpakhô chay ta, thisaih a thia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta alei hipa liata siepa hawhta Tilaipi Saihpa ama chaka. Izi mo deikua cha, cha hawhta tao a chhuah hra ei ta, ti ta a vaosao khai ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta Zerikô thokhy cha, noh sari ama chahlô tawhta a cho haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ngiapâna ta âzuahnô Rahâbi cha, mohparutuhpazy a phapa ta â lypa vâta, ngiapâleipazy hry liata leidia vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khâpa eima reih khao aw? Kidia, Bâraka, Sâsawna, Zephathâ, Dâvi, Samuela nata hrohsopazy kyh reih aw sah la, daihti ta nâ daih aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Âmo cha ngiapâna ta khinarâhzy la ei ta, adona a duakhei ei ta, bietaizy to ei ta, chakeibarôhneipa pakahzy ama pamosa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mei hmotaotheina pachhai ei ta, zaozi tiahpa khôkhâh ei ta, chiehleina tawhta thatlôpa ta taopa ama châ. Adyuhna liata pasaipha châ ei ta, chihropa pheisaihzy a chadai ei ta amâ râpai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chanôzy ta ama chyhsa athipa thyuheihpazy hmô ei ta. Thokhazy cha taolapa ta y hra ei sala, hro pha viapa lâta ama thyuheih thei nawpa ta, pua awpa khoh hlei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mohropazy chhao pasipasawhna nata tuna zy vâta pasa tao ei ta, bâlia nata patâhna zy amâ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Alô ta vawhpa châ ei ta, thoâna ta taipachhôpa châ ei ta, reipasaona a tyh ei ta, zaozi ta chhawhsaopa ama châ. Mietaku vo nata mie vo zy a bupa ta viavi ei ta, dyhchhiena, pasataona nata â doleipa ta ama chô liata hmotaopazy amâ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chazy châta la, khizaw he yna tlâh châ vei. Râhchawhpa liatazy, tlâh liatazy, lôpu nata khaohtlô liatazy viavipa ta ama y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cha chyhsa zydua cha, amâ ngiapâna vâta reithaina hlao tlai ei ta, bietaipa deikua hmô mâh veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Khazohpa ta keimo châta hmo pha viapa â chhuahdy hapa vâta, âmo nata keimo â raohpa ta pakipa ta y awpa ta â chhuanoh hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha ngiapâna bie pahnokheituhpazy ta meihdo ru ngaitapa hawhta miah ama pahlypa vâna heta, miah pahny pakhawpa maih nata moleina keimo liata khâchâ a baipa cha soh sih la, eima hmiakô liata arâpasuana a ypa liata tiama ngaitapa ta a râ lymâ suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eimâ ngiapâna apahniehna nata pakituhpa Zisu lâ moh lymâ ei suh u. Ano cha a hmiakô liata alyna sopa cha a to thei nawpa ta, maophyuhna chhao papeisa leipa ta, kraws liata pasa tao ta, Khazohpa beidyuchhai chachâh lâta a kaw tyuh ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nama palôh thazei leipa ta, nama tha a chhâ lei nawpa ta, moleipazy ta amâ dyuhna vâta pasa a taopa Zisu thâtih pachâ tyh muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moleina namâ dyuhna liata, thisaih lona taihta a dyuh mâh veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawzy chhoreipa hawhta pasyuna biezy kha nama my ha ma? “Ei saw y, Abeipa chhoreina cha, Papeisa leipa ta y leipa la; A cha ra tita, Na palôh pasa khah sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abeipa ta a kyhpachâpa cha chhorei ta, Saw ta â pyhpa maih a chhei tyh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nama pha nawpa ta chhoreipa nama châ. Sawzy chô liata taopa hawhta Khazohpa ta nama chô liata a tao. Paw chhorei leipa saw ahy ma a y beih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saw zydua cha chhorei tyhpa ama châ. Chavâta chhoreipa nama châ vei khiahta cha, saw hmeiseihpa châ leipa ei chi ta, riasawzy nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha dei châ vei, lei liata miah chhoreituhpa pawzy hnei pi ta, âmo cha eima za ngaita. Eima hroh thei nawpa ta, eima thlahpazy Paw cha, cha hlâta tha via ta eima za awpa châ vei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei liata eima pawzy ta daihti chyuta chhôh, pha ama tahzie hawhta miah chhorei ei ta, Abeipa deikua cha, eima pha nawpa ta tlao miah a chhorei tyh. Chatanachata a pathaihna eimâ hly thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhoreina zydua he, a tyh nota cha alychhihpa châ leipa ta, a pasa kaw tyh. Pasa tao khai tawhta deikua cha, chhoreipa ta a ypazy châta thei thlalôh chhihpa, siana thei a pathei tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chavâta nama bâh pathliahpazy chalo u la, nama pakhu thazeipazy thapatlô teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pheisypa cha a ru a suhlie leipa ta, patlâhpa a châ thei nawpa ta, nama pheizy châta lâpi patlâpazy tao teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chyhsa zydua nata adyhna chadai u la, pathaihna chadai hra teh u. Pathaihna leipa ta ahy hmahta Abeipa hmô aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khazohpa ngiachhiena a to leipa ama y lei nawpa ta, pakhâta ta moh u la, palôh chhiepa vaw pua sala, tymâna patlôsapa ta, chyhsa hluhpi papuapaleipa ama châ lei nawpa ta, pakhâta ta moh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Apatlana moleina a taopa y leipa ta, Esaw hawhta pathaih leipa ama y lei nawpa ta, pakhâta ta moh teh u. Esaw cha pati ei kha nie ta sawchapaw uhtheipa châna a zuahpa kha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta byhnâ to awpa khoh ta, mothlih chhaota a hiapa chhao ta, ro nawpa daihti rypaohpa a hmô khao leipa vâta, dythapa a châpa kha nama pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ku ta hria theipa tlâh, meipaleih a puapa, zohna nata zoh kaluhna ta a khupa nata thlihpi pathlina tlâh lâ namâ vypa châ leipa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />chiahmie tôpa pyu nata a bie reipa ao vâta, a theituhpazy ta ama hnohta bie hropa rai rei khao lei awpa ta amâ hawna tlâh lâ a vypa châ veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tlâh cha sa ta hmah a hria khiahta cha, alô ta vawhsao awpa a châ,” tahpa biepiepa ama pahnie leipa vâta a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama hmo hmôpa kha chichhih ngaitapa châ tlai ta, chavâta Mawsi chhao ta, “Chipa ta thata ei chalyu,” a tahpa kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nâmo deikua la, Zaio Tlâh, Khazohpa hrohpa khihpi, vâ Zerusale, vâlyuhchâpa rei tiah leizy alyna pakhypi su lâ namâ vy hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vârâh liata moh ropa sawchapaw uhtheipazy yna Awnanopa lâ a vy ei chi ta, mo to pachiatuhpa Khazohpa nata phapakipa ta taopa mosiapa sahlao thlahpazy lâ namâ vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Biehrai thiehpa lyuhchâpa Zisu lâ a vy ei chi ta, Abela thisaih hlâta bie pha viapa a reihpa Zisu thisaih thiapa lâ namâ vy hih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biereituhpa khoh leipa ta nama y pathlei lei nawpa ta a chado teh u. Alei liata zikyurâtuhpazy khoh leipa hmahta hriena ama khôkhâh vei khiahta cha, vârâh tawhta zikyu miah râtuhpa eima dytha khiahta cha, hriena eima khôkhâh lei pachai aw dia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kha daihti liata a ao ta alei he chalyu ta, tahmâ deikua, “Ei kha cha alei dei châ leipa ta, avâ chhao ei chalyu heih aw,” tahpa ta bie â taih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ei kha cha ei chalyu heih aw,” tahpa heta, hmo a chalyu leipazy a y ualua ta a y lymâ thei nawpa ta, hmo a chalyupazy cha, hmotaopazy hawhta pasiepa ta a y aw tahpa a palâsa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chatanachata khinarâh a chalyu thei leipa eima topa vâna heta, alyna châh pahno sih la, a pyh tlâhpa achhyna cha, china nata zana chôta Khazohpa lâ hlâ ei suh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />eima Khazohpa he a kâ patlô theipa mei châ tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unawh kyhpachâna y lymâ mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khichhai chô liata phana papua awpa my khuh vy. Cha hawhta taopa ta, thokhazy ta pahno leipa ta vâlyuhchâpazy ama o liata ama patlôsa tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Patâhna o liata atâhpazy cha, ama hnohta patâhna o liata y hrapa hawhta a pachâ u la, a thei thlâh ha muh vy. Riethei pataosapazy chhao, sapa ta a ypa nama châ hrapa vâta, a thei thlâh ha teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nôvah ahneina he chyhsa zydua hry liata palyupalihpa ta y mawh sy. Nôvah rakhô chhao papuapaleipa châ khah sy. Apatlana moleina a taopazy nata apheipazy cha Khazohpa ta a pachia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nama hro cha tâkâ sôh tlaichhaina a hlao leipa châ sala, nama hneipa rakha liata palôhtlâh a pao muh vy. Abeipa ta, “Cha pathlua beih leipa aw ei na ta, cha siesai beih aw veih ei na,” a tah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chavâta riahphapa ta, “Abeipa cha nâ baotuhpa châ ta, Chi aw va na; Chyhsa ta kheihta eina tao thei aw?” Eima tah ngâh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khazohpa bie châ chhotuhpa nama hyutuhpazy a thei thlâh ha u la, ama hro liata hmo phapazy pachâ u la, amâ ngiapâna hâ a la teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zisu Krista cha zâhia nata tanoh nata chhâzaw ta a ualua ta a y thlâhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachuna nanopa nata noâhchhihpazy ta paviasapa ta y khuh vy. Palôh he niedo ta thapatlô awpa châ leipa ta, ngiachhiena ta thapatlô awpa tlao a châ. Niedo kyh sai ta a tymâkheipazy châta niedo ta athôhna tlôkhei hlei vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimo cha maisâh hnei pi ta, keimo maisâh liata deikua cha, achhyna byureih chakaotuhpazy nie thei veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Theihthai beichaipa ta moleina atheihna châta Su Pathaih Chaipa lâ a thisaih â ngiakheipa sahroh pôhpazy cha, riehmo khôtho lâta rao tyhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Zisu chhao ta ano thisaih tlai ta chyhsazy a pathaisa thei nawpa ta, khihpi thokhy khôtho liata pasa a vaw tao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chavâta riehmo khôtho liata ano yna lâ pua sih la, reipachhiena a phaopazy cha phaokhei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />He liata khihpi sôhpahlôhpa hnei tlôh lei khâh pi ta, khihpi a vaw y awpa cha tlao eima tlua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatanachata ano zawhzi ta reithaina atheihna cha Khazohpa hnohta khâ hlâ suh vy. Cha cha a moh achâhkheina hmaozy theilâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmo pha tao my leipa u la, nama hneipazy a chhaih awpa my khuh vy. Cha hawhpa atheihnazy ta Khazohpa a palysa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nama hyutuhpazy rei a ngiah u la, ama biehneina liata a ngiarih teh u. Khazohpa hmiakô liata nama thâtih a reih awpazy châ ei ta, pachârôhna chôta châ leipa ta, a ly kawpa ta nama thâtih ama rei thei nawpa ta nama thlahpa a vaituhpazy ama châ. Pachârôhna chôta nama thâtih reipa cha, nama châta phahnai aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlah miah chhâpa teh u. Kyh to liata zachhihpa ta y a chhuah pi ta, chhie nata pha pahnona pasohpa eima hnei tahpa a siapa ta eima pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A chatlie viapa ta nâmo lâ ei vy heih thei nawpa ta, a eih viapa ta thlah eina chhâkhei awpa ei chi ta ei châ haw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tahmâ he thlalôhna Khazohpa, eima Beipa Zisu athihpa hry tawhta a pahro heihpa, chhâzaw biehrai thisaih vâta mietaku vaituhpa rônahpa ta
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a khopa nama tao thei nawpa ta hmo pha to ta cha tobi ei sala, a mohmô liata â lynazie ta nama y lymâ thei nawpa ta, Zisu Krista zawhzi ta nâmo liata hria lymâ sala, Zisu Krista hnohta chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta rônahna y mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Unawh saih u, nama hnohta pasyuna bie chyuta ei vaw ropa he nama pahno thai awpa ta ei châ haw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eima unawhpa Timawthy cha, patâhna o tawhta ama papua haw tahpa vaw pahno muh vy. A vaw tlô patoh khiahta cha, ano nata eima châ vaw hmô aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nama hyutuhpa zydua nata mopathaihpa zydua nâ naohpa muh vy. Itali râh tawhta a vypazy ta ama châ naoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nama zydua hnohta ngiachhiena y mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
